# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Patient data must NEVER enter this repository.
#
# The MVA Hackathon 2026 dataset is gated and governed by a Data Transfer
# Agreement: redistribution is prohibited and all data (including intermediate
# and derived datasets) must be deleted within 30 days of the hackathon close.
# This repository therefore contains code and methods only.
#
# Deny by default for every data-bearing extension, then allow back the few
# text files that are genuinely code or documentation.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Genomic / alignment data
*.vcf
*.vcf.gz
*.vcf.gz.tbi
*.bcf
*.bam
*.cram
*.sam
*.bai
*.crai
*.fastq
*.fastq.gz
*.fq
*.fq.gz
*.fa
*.fa.gz
*.fasta
*.fai
*.mmi
*.gtf
*.gtf.gz
*.bed

# Tabular / serialised results (may carry proband genotypes)
*.tsv
*.csv
*.json
*.jsonl
*.xlsx
*.h5
*.parquet

# Clinical documents
*.docx
*.pdf

# Proband phenotype (from the gated clinical document)
config/phenotype.txt

# Working directories from the analysis
cache/
results/
fastq_pass/
control_pass/
validation/work/
mva-data/
exomiser/

# Environment
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
.env
.DS_Store

# Allow back: documentation and the config template only
!README.md
!report/*.md
!config/phenotype.example.txt
